WoTEx supplied logo

The project maintainer supplied and selected wotex-logo-light.svg on
2026-10-21. The source is preserved byte-for-byte.
SHA-256: db6988632bafbc369ccf12cbb939a0b097886b424d8135d7e6a5cd4fbc19bc9c

The exports/ directory contains native Figma representations and application
artwork derived from that supplied mark. Default retains its gradient colors.
Dark changes only #181D27 to #D6DBE3 and #303644 to #9097A5; Monochrome uses a
solid foreground. Geometry, aspect ratio and clipping are retained. The derived
treatments and application layouts are design proposals. Their source nodes,
file hashes, dimensions and export checks are recorded in exports/README.md.
No font binary is redistributed with these artwork files.

The supplied/ directory preserves three unique Carbon fold SVG treatments from
the maintainer-provided Wotex/Logo asset set, including both neutral grayscale
gradient variants. The Default source also appeared as master.svg and
logo-dark.svg with identical bytes. Source aliases, hashes and vector checks
are recorded in supplied/README.md. These additional source assets do not
replace the previously selected original or establish native Figma adoption.

The earlier artwork under draft/ remains historical and carries its own notice.
